        "endpoint": "Finish with the working elbow extended while keeping hold of the sleeve.",
        "returnPhase": "Brace and guide the sleeve back to the rear shoulder under control, then reset the stance.",
        "controlledJoints": "Let the rear foot turn with the hips instead of twisting through a fixed knee.",
        "supportAndPosture": "Remain balanced and keep the bar path clear.",
